  Terminal: Super + Return\n\
  Kill Window: Super + C\n\
󰈆  Exit Hyprland: Super + Shift + E\n\
  File Manager: Super + E\n\
  Floating Toggle: Super + V\n\
  App Launcher: Alt + Space\n\
  Pseudo Tiling: Super + P\n\
  Toggle Split: Super + Shift + J\n\
  Fullscreen: Super + F\n\
  Screenshot: Alt + P\n\
  AUR Install: Super + A\n\
  Kill Process: Super + K\n\
  Arch Menu: Super + Shift + Space\n\
\n\
  Workspaces 1-6: Alt + 1-6\n\
  Move to Workspace: Super + Shift + 1-6\n\
  Special Workspace: Super + \`\n\
  Show Scratchpad: Super + S\n\
\n\
  Focus: Super + H/J/K/L\n\
  Move: Super + Shift + H/J/K/L\n\
  Resize: Super + Ctrl + H/J/K/L\n\
\n\
󱐋  Performance: Super + Alt + P\n\
  Balanced: Super + Alt + B\n\
󰾆  Power Save: Super + Alt + S\n\
\n\
  Volume Up: XF86AudioRaiseVolume\n\
  Volume Down: XF86AudioLowerVolume\n\
  Mute: XF86AudioMute\n\
  Brightness Up: XF86MonBrightnessUp\n\
  Brightness Down: XF86MonBrightnessDown\n\
\n\
